YMM4M cumulative Wine Direct2D compatibility patch
Upstream base: db11d0fe6a169c457e23d007e20404643d067aa8
Includes upstream fix: c2f0d81c7b91c8327fb8bf7ad53ed637abedd3e5
Scope: null effect inputs, 3D transform registration and properties, image bounds,
       command-list bounds/replay, target offsets, transparent Clear semantics,
       nested image brushes, and effect/command-list drawing.
Validation: d2d-null-effect-input-reproducer, d2d-3d-transform-reproducer,
            15 Direct2D lifecycle cycles, YMM4 Lite PNG/audio preview playback,
            and a centered H.264/AAC FFmpeg export.
Removal condition: replace with upstream Wine implementations once the same public
                   Direct2D contracts and YMM4 workflows pass without this patch.

